---@field exclude_from_article_suggestions? boolean Whether the article is excluded from Fin AI Agent article suggestions.
---@field help_center_audience? intercom.ArticleHelpCenterAudience|distilled.Null The audience that can view this article in the Help Center. `everyone` means all users and visitors can view it; `restricted` indicates a custom audience ruleset. For multilingual articles, this is the article-level audience.
