---@class intercom.GetArticleDraftResponse
---@field type? intercom.GetArticleDraftResponseType The type of object - `article`.
---@field id? string The unique identifier for the article which is given by Intercom.
---@field workspace_id? string The id of the workspace which the article belongs to.
---@field title? string The title of the article. For multilingual articles, this will be the title of the default language's content.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null The description of the article. For multilingual articles, this will be the description of the default language's content.
---@field body? string|distilled.Null The body of the article in HTML. For multilingual articles, this will be the body of the default language's content.
---@field body_markdown? string|distilled.Null The body of the article in markdown. For multilingual articles, this will be the body of the default language's content.
