---{% /admonition %}
---
---`POST /fin/reply`
---Errors: BadRequest.
---@param input intercom.ReplyToFinRequest
---@return intercom.ReplyToFinResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:reply_to_fin(input) end

